Almost all of the rendering engine is the work of the ironpress authors.

Some design ideas were taken from fullbleed
  https://github.com/fullbleed-engine/fullbleed-official
  Copyright (c) 2026 Fullbleed Contributors, MIT License.
Only ideas were borrowed: the golden regression manifest (output hashes
plus optional rasterized pages, with verify and regenerate modes), and the
PDF/A profile and compiled-template / data-binding directions described in
ROADMAP.md. No fullbleed source code is included in this repository; the
implementations here are independent.
